            "review_text": "World Consulting Développement (MOF)\nKyiv, Ukraine3 contributions\n4\nAvoid this address No culinary research, no flavor, industrial foods priced at the price of homemade\nAug 2023 • Business\nTO AVOID THIS IS THE WORST ITALIAN RESTAURANT IN ASIA!!\nWe had never seen such a lousy, bad and very expensive restaurant.\nA restaurant that has no culinary identity, no flavor. It's anything but Italian cuisine. No search for creativity, plates prepared like in a fast food restaurant, moreover the food is industrial type, nothing is \"homemade\", we have to be honest it is barely edible, unacceptable!!\nThe room is extremely sad, the staff are amateurs, the kitchen too... An address to avoid, I would even say to flee because the cuisine is so bad and expensive.\nIn Thao Dien there are a lot of expats but most of those we met smiled when we told them where we had dinner. Unfortunately we fell into the trap of a fake Italian restaurant which charges you an exorbitant price for its dishes given the quality served.\nThe dishes are said to be cooked in the Italian style.....we have not found the flavors of our Italy. Boni liars for sure, but not Italians, certainly Vietnamese (managers/bosses).\nA shame for Italian cuisine. I do not recommend this restaurant La Cala By Mia 10 Tran Ngoc Dien, Thao Dien, Thu Duc, Ho Chi Minh City Vietnam.\nTHIS RESTAURANT NEEDS TO BE CLOSED to protect the health of customers.\n\nWe are professionals in the hotel and catering sector\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nShow original\nWritten August 30, 2023",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-14",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
